label Greeting
# [signal arg="refresh_desires"]
Buboy: Hehe! [pause=1.0]
Buboy: Stay there, [i]Damulag[/i]!
Buboy: Don't eat the grass here, okay?
Buboy: They might get mad!
Buboy: Hehe!
Buboy: Hello po!
Buboy: Mama told me to buy something...
Buboy: But I forgot what it was called again!
Buboy: Hehe!
Buboy: But I kind of remember what it looks like!
jump Riddle

label Riddle
# Buboy describes the item based on {Transaction_HighestItemWants}.
# Same funny child "utos" descriptions — no item name ever mentioned!
if {Transaction_HighestItemWants} == "Argentita Corned Beef":
	Buboy: The heavy round tin!
	Buboy: There's a fancy tita lady on the picture!
	Buboy: Mama opens it with this spinning wheel thing...
	Buboy: It goes RRRRRRRR until the top falls off!
	Buboy: The beefy tita tin! You have that?!

elif {Transaction_HighestItemWants} == "Cenchuree Tuna":
	Buboy: The flat flat tin! Not the tall one! The FLAT flat one!
	Buboy: Like a coin but bigger! And heavier!
	Buboy: It smells like the fish section in the market!
	Buboy: Mama always fans herself when she opens it.
	Buboy: Hihi! The flat fish one!

elif {Transaction_HighestItemWants} == "Scam":
	Buboy: The rectangle can!
	Buboy: The long square one with pink meat inside!
	Buboy: You slice it flat and fry it in a pan!
	Buboy: I like it when the edges get a little brown!
	Buboy: That one! The square meat can! Hihi!

elif {Transaction_HighestItemWants} == "Lucky9":
	Buboy: The can with the number on it!
	Buboy: NINE! Nine is lucky Mama says!
	Buboy: The lucky number can!
	Buboy: That one!

elif {Transaction_HighestItemWants} == "Mema":
	Buboy: Um...
	Buboy: Mama said a word and I said "hah?"
	Buboy: And she said just go get it!
	Buboy: I think it's a tin or a can.
	Buboy: [pause=0.4] Sorry that's all I know. Hehe.

elif {Transaction_HighestItemWants} == "Anoba":
	Buboy: The flat crunchy things stacked on each other!
	Buboy: Like a little tower of crackers you can eat!
	Buboy: They break SO easily when you drop them!
	Buboy: I dropped them once. [pause=0.5] Mama was NOT happy.
	Buboy: But I still ate all the broken pieces! Hihi!

elif {Transaction_HighestItemWants} == "Patos":
	Buboy: Oh! I think I know it!
	Buboy: Pato! Duck! There's kinda a duck on the bag!
	Buboy: And after you eat them your fingers go super yellow!
	Buboy: Then you lick your fingers and it tastes like cheese!
	Buboy: The yellow duck bag! Hihi!

elif {Transaction_HighestItemWants} == "Ding Dong Dantes":
	Buboy: The noisy bag with all the mixed things inside!
	Buboy: Small round ones! Flat ones! All together!
	Buboy: When you shake it it goes TATATATATA!
	Buboy: I like shaking it before opening.
	Buboy: Mama says stop but it's so fun! Hehe!

elif {Transaction_HighestItemWants} == "Marites Cracklin'":
	Buboy: The one that goes CRUNCH CRUNCH CRUNCH in your mouth!
	Buboy: Like stepping on dried leaves! But LOUDER!
	Buboy: And Mama says it's from the pig's...
	Buboy: [pause=0.6] Don't think about it. I don't think about it.
	Buboy: I just eat it! Hihi!

elif {Transaction_HighestItemWants} == "Ngarag-Ya":
	Buboy: You know when Mama cooks adobo?
	Buboy: And the WHOLE house smells SO good?
	Buboy: It's a snack bag that smells exactly like THAT!
	Buboy: Like adobo! But in a tiny bag!
	Buboy: Weird and delicious! Hehe!

elif {Transaction_HighestItemWants} == "Champyon":
	Buboy: Um...
	Buboy: The white sticks in a box. That make smoke.
	Buboy: I'm not allowed to touch them. Mama said.
	Buboy: [pause=0.5] But Papa still sends me to get them. Hihi.

elif {Transaction_HighestItemWants} == "Marboro":
	Buboy: The RED box!
	Buboy: With the small white sticks inside!
	Buboy: NOT the blue box! The RED one!
	Buboy: The adult smoke thing but the RED box!
	Buboy: You know! The red one!

elif {Transaction_HighestItemWants} == "Kokaloka":
	Buboy: Ohhhh the dark bubbly drink!
	Buboy: Not water! The DARK colored one in a bottle!
	Buboy: And when you open it — PSHHHHH!
	Buboy: And the bubbles jump into your NOSE!
	Buboy: And I sneeze every time! Hihi!

elif {Transaction_HighestItemWants} == "Water":
	Buboy: Just water po!
	Buboy: The clear bottle!
	Buboy: With... water inside.
	Buboy: Normal water! It's just water!
	Buboy: Hihi!

elif {Transaction_HighestItemWants} == "Gin":
	Buboy: Um...
	Buboy: The tall bottle with the strong clear drink.
	Buboy: It smells like cleaning water but for drinking?
	Buboy: Papa needs it.
	Buboy: [pause=0.6] Mama doesn't know he asked me.
	Buboy: Please don't tell her po. Hehe.

elif {Transaction_HighestItemWants} == "Chubs":
	Buboy: The soft little chewy ones!
	Buboy: Like tiny edible pillows!
	Buboy: They come in lots of different colors!
	Buboy: I once tried to save some for later.
	Buboy: [pause=0.4] I ate them in two minutes. Hehe.

elif {Transaction_HighestItemWants} == "Mentor":
	Buboy: The long plastic roll!
	Buboy: With flat round things inside!
	Buboy: You push them out one by one! Pop! Pop! Pop!
	Buboy: And your tongue feels cold after each one!
	Buboy: Like a tiny cold circle! Hihi!

elif {Transaction_HighestItemWants} == "Pocha":
	Buboy: Small candy in a pack!
	Buboy: Chewy! Or hard? I always forget!
	Buboy: But it's sweet and good!
	Buboy: Mama lets me get one for myself sometimes!
	Buboy: Hihi! That one!

elif {Transaction_HighestItemWants} == "Pampanga's Good Tocino":
	Buboy: The sweet pink meat in the cold cold box!
	Buboy: When Mama fries it the whole street smells it!
	Buboy: I stand right next to the pan and just breathe!
	Buboy: It smells like candy but it's MEAT!
	Buboy: Sweet meat from the cold section! Hihi!

elif {Transaction_HighestItemWants} == "Purified Foods Tender Juicy":
	Buboy: The long pink sausage!
	Buboy: In a pack! A bunch of them!
	Buboy: For soup or for frying!
	Buboy: I like the burnt edges! Hehe!

elif {Transaction_HighestItemWants} == "Borgir":
	Buboy: The flat round frozen thing from the cold section!
	Buboy: You fry it and it becomes like a burger!
	Buboy: Like making your own burger at home!
	Buboy: Is that one here? Hihi!

elif {Transaction_HighestItemWants} == "Nagets":
	Buboy: The small frozen chicken pieces!
	Buboy: Small and round and frozen!
	Buboy: You fry them and they go CRUNCH!
	Buboy: I can eat like TEN of them!
	Buboy: No wait — TWELVE! Hihi!

elif {Transaction_HighestItemWants} == "Aryel":
	Buboy: The tiny packet that smells SO clean!
	Buboy: Like the cleanest smell in the world!
	Buboy: Mama mixes it in water for the clothes!
	Buboy: I put my face near the bubbles once.
	Buboy: [pause=0.5] My eyes hurt a lot. Hehe. Don't do that.

elif {Transaction_HighestItemWants} == "Knees and Toes":
	Buboy: The small packet for the bathroom!
	Buboy: Is it for feet? Or hair? Or BOTH?!
	Buboy: The name sounds like a children's song!
	Buboy: Knees and... [pause=0.4] Hihi I forget the rest.
	Buboy: The small bath packet! That one po!

elif {Transaction_HighestItemWants} == "Kopimo":
	Buboy: The small brown packet!
	Buboy: You mix it in hot water and it turns all dark brown!
	Buboy: Papa drinks it every single morning!
	Buboy: I tried it once.
	Buboy: [pause=0.7] Very very bitter.
	Buboy: I don't understand adults at all. Hehe!

elif {Transaction_HighestItemWants} == "Dadi Chicken na Chicken":
	Buboy: The flat bag with the dried noodle BRICK inside!
	Buboy: It looks like a hard brick but it's food!
	Buboy: There's a chicken picture on the bag!
	Buboy: You pour hot water and it becomes noodles!
	Buboy: MAGIC! Hihi!

elif {Transaction_HighestItemWants} == "Pantit Canton":
	Buboy: The yellow noodle bag!
	Buboy: Not the soupy kind! The thick yellow one!
	Buboy: You fry it with oil!
	Buboy: There's a tiny sour packet inside!
	Buboy: I always add extra calamansi! Hihi!

else:
	Buboy: Umm...
	Buboy: I forgot how to describe this one exactly.
	Buboy: Mama told me while I was thinking about my kite.
	Buboy: Hehe. Sorry po!
	Buboy: It's... something from the store!
[end_timeline]

label Talk
Buboy: Hehe!
Buboy: [i]Damulag[/i] is getting sleepy waiting outside!
Buboy: Okay okay! Let me say it again!
jump Riddle

label Partial
# [signal arg="refresh_desires"]
Buboy: Hehe!
Buboy: Wow, thank you po!
if {Transaction_RemainingCount} > 0:
	Buboy: But I still need one more thing!
	Buboy: Let me describe it again!
	jump Riddle
Buboy: Hehe!
[end_timeline]

label Satisfy
if {Transaction_WantsDebt}:
	Buboy: Hehe!
	Buboy: Oh wait...
	Buboy: I dropped my coins in the mud earlier!
	Buboy: Hehe!
	Buboy: Is it okay if I pay tomorrow?
	Buboy: I promise Mama will bring the coins!
	- Okay
		Player: That's fine, Buboy. Tell your Mama.
		[signal arg="utang_accepted"]
		Buboy: Hehe! You're the best, po!
		Buboy: Let's go, [i]Damulag[/i]!
	- No
		Player: Sorry Buboy, I need the coins now.
		[signal arg="utang_rejected"]
		Buboy: Aww...
		Buboy: Okay po... I'll be back!
else:
	Buboy: Hehe!
	Buboy: Perfect!
	Buboy: Mama will be so happy!
	Buboy: Thank you, po!
	Buboy: Hehe!
	Buboy: Come on, [i]Damulag[/i]! Let's go home!
[signal arg="story_success"]
[end_timeline]

label WrongItem
Buboy: Hehe!
Buboy: Hmm... That's not it, po!
Buboy: Let me say it again!
jump Riddle
